OL,3,GNEWSACharity hoping for more emergency 
OL,4,Ahomeless pods                          
OL,6,FEmergency shelters for homeless people 
OL,7,Fin Guernsey could be erected in a car  
OL,8,Fpark.                                  
OL,10,FA planning application has been        
OL,11,Fsubmitted for two insulated            
OL,12,Fsolar-powered sleeping pods in La      
OL,13,FSalerie car park next to the Queen     
OL,14,FElizabeth Marina in St Peter Port.     
OL,16,FThe Caritas Community Charitable Trust 
OL,17,Fhas applied to erect the pods to       
OL,18,Fprovide short term accommodation for   
OL,19,Fpeople in need while a longer term home
OL,20,Fand access to essential services is    
OL,21,Ffound.                                 
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
