OL,3,GNEWSACharity hoping for more emergency 
OL,4,Ahomeless pods                          
OL,6,FChris Martel from DRP Architecture said
OL,7,Fthe pods offered a "humane and         
OL,8,Feffective response to a recognised gap 
OL,9,Fin community infrastructure".          
